aura_consensus::proposer — deterministic round-robin over N validators
(validators[round % len]). Panics on empty validator set.

aura_consensus::signature — Ed25519 block signature over
hash_domain(chain_id, Domain::Block, block_hash). SignedBlock bundles
a block with its proposer signature.

