- CHANGELOG entry, CONSENSUS_PLAN.md receipt + ✅ B1 row
- docs/NODE.md + docs/STATUS.md updated

Gates: 22 unit tests, D0 13/13, D1 12/12, B1 22/22, 6/6 NC,
make test ALL GREEN (32 phases C0-B1, 183 NC expected)
